#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.title"
msgstr "Reform drwa dotor neseser pou sekirite nasional"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.tldr"
msgstr "TL;DR: LLM Chinwa (inkli DeepSeek) zot antrene lor mo larkiv ilegal liv ek papie — pli gran dan lemond. Loksidan bizin revwar lalwa drwa dotor kouma enn kestion sekirite nasional."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.subtitle"
msgstr "artik lor TorrentFreak: <a %(torrentfreak)s>premie</a>, <a %(torrentfreak_2)s>deziem</a>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text1"
msgstr "Pa tro lontan, “shadow-libraries” ti pe disparet. Sci-Hub, gran larkiv ilegal papie akademik, ti aret pran nouvo travay, akoz poursuit. “Z-Library”, pli gran bibliotèk ilegal liv, ti trouv so sipoze kreater arete pou akizasyon kriminel drwa dotor. Zot ti reisi sove zot arestasyon, me zot bibliotèk pa mwins menase."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text2"
msgstr "Kan Z-Library ti fer fas a fermtir, mo ti’nn deza fer enn backup so bibliotèk antye ek ti pe rod enn platform pou abrit li. Sa ti mo motivasyon pou koumans Larkiv Anna: enn kontinyasyon misyon deryer sa bann inisiativ avan. Nou’nn grandi depi sa pou vinn pli gran shadow library dan lemond, abrit plis ki 140 milyon teks drwa dotor atraver plizir format — liv, papie akademik, magazin, zournal, ek plis ankor."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text3"
msgstr "Mo lekip ek mwa nou bann ideolog. Nou krwar ki prezerv ek abrit sa bann dosie la li moralman korek. Bibliotèk otour lemond pe trouv koupe dan finansman, ek nou pa kapav met konfians dan patrimwann limanite avek korporasyon osi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text4"
msgstr "Apre sa, AI ti vini. Preske tou gran konpani ki pe konstrir LLM ti kontakte nou pou antrene lor nou done. Laplipar (me pa tou!) konpani baze dan Lamerik ti reconsidere kan zot ti realize natir ilegal nou travay. An kontrast, konpani Chinwa finn anbras nou koleksyon avek antouziaz, san traka pou so legalite. Sa notab done rol Lasinn kouma signater preske tou gran trete internasyonal drwa dotor."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text5"
msgstr "Nou finn donn akse gran vitess a anviron 30 konpani. Laplipar zot konpani LLM, ek sertin zot broker done, ki pou revann nou koleksyon. Laplipar zot Chinwa, me nou’nn osi travay avek konpani depi Lamerik, Lerop, Larisi, Kore di Sid, ek Zapon. DeepSeek <a %(arxiv)s>admet</a> ki enn versyon avan ti antrene lor enn parti nou koleksyon, mem si zot pe gard silans lor zot dernie model (probableman osi antrene lor nou done)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text6"
msgstr "Si l’Ouest anvi res devan dan kours LLM, ek finalman, AGI, li bizin reget so pozisyon lor drwa doter, ek byento. Ki ou dakor avek nou ou pa lor nou ka moral, sa pe vinn enn ka ekonomik, ek mem enn ka sekirite nasionnal. Tou bann blok pouvwar pe konstrir bann super-sians, super-hacker, ek super-militer artifisyel. Liberte linformasyon pe vinn enn kestyon sirvi pou sa bann pei-la — mem enn kestyon sekirite nasionnal."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text7"
msgstr "Nou lekip sorti partou dan lemond, ek nou pena enn alians partikilye. Me nou ankouraz bann pei avek bann lalwa drwa doter for pou servi sa menas egzistansyel-la pou reform zot. Alor ki pou fer?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text8"
msgstr "Nou premie rekomandasion li senp: redwir dire drwa doter. Dan l’Amerik, drwa doter donn pou 70 an apre lamor loter. Sa li absird. Nou kapav alinn sa avek bann brev, ki donn pou 20 an apre depo. Sa bizin plis ki ase letan pou bann loter liv, papie, lamizik, lart, ek lezot travay kreatif, pou gagn konpansasion total pou zot zefor (inklir bann proze long term kouma adaptasion sinematik)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text9"
msgstr "Apre sa, o minimum, bann desideur bizin inklir bann eksepsyon pou mas-preservasion ek difizion bann text. Si perdi reveni depi bann kliyan individiel li pli gran traka, distribision o nivo personel kapav res enterdir. An retour, bann ki kapav zere bann gran repozitwar — bann konpani ki antrenn LLM, ansam avek bann bibliotèk ek lezot archive — pou kouver par sa bann eksepsyon-la."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text10"
msgstr "Sertin pei pe deza fer enn versyon sa. TorrentFreak <a %(torrentfreak)s>raporte</a> ki Lasinn ek Japon inn introdwir eksepsyon AI dan zot lalwa drwa doter. Li pa kler pou nou kouma sa interagis avek bann trete internasyonal, me li sirman donn kouver pou zot konpani domestik, ki explike seki nou finn pe trouve."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text11"
msgstr "Kouma pou Anna’s Archive — nou pou kontinie nou travay anba later baze lor konviksyon moral. Me nou pli gran swaf se pou rant dan lalimier, ek amplifie nou linpak legalman. Silvouple reform drwa doter."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.signature"
msgstr "- Anna ek l’équipe (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.postscript"
msgstr "Lir bann lartik konpayon par TorrentFreak: <a %(torrentfreak)s>premie</a>, <a %(torrentfreak_2)s>deziem</a>"

