#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winner.text6"
msgstr "Nou ti lans enn defi pou amelyor sa. Nou ti pou donn enn premie pri $6,000, deziem pri $3,000, ek trwaziem pri $1,000. An rezilta enn repons extraordiner ek soumision inkrwayab, nou’n deside ogmant enn tigit pri total, ek donn kat trwaziem pri $500 sakenn. Bann gagnan zot anba, me asire ou get tou soumision <a %(annas_archive)s>isi</a>, ouswa telecharg nou <a %(a_2025_01_isbn_visualization_files)s>torrent konbine</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.first"
msgstr "Premie pri $6,000: phiresky"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.first.text1"
msgstr "Sa <a %(phiresky_github)s>soumision</a> (<a %(annas_archive_note_2951)s>komanter Gitlab</a>) la li zis tou seki nou ti anvi, ek plis ankor! Nou ti bien kontan bann opsion visualizasyon extraordiner fleksib (mem soutir bann shaders personnalize), me avek enn lalis preset konpreansif. Nou ti osi kontan kouma tou zafer rapid ek dou, implementasyon senp (ki mem pena enn backend), minimap entelizan, ek explikasion detaye dan zot <a %(phiresky_github)s>post blog</a>. Travay inkrwayab, ek enn gagnan bien merite!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.second"
msgstr "Deziem pri $3,000: hypha"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.second.text1"
msgstr "Enn lot <a %(annas_archive_note_2913)s>soumision</a> inkrwayab. Pa osi fleksib ki premie pri, me nou ti prefer so visualizasyon nivo-makro par rapor a premie pri (kourb ki ranpli lespas, frontyer, etikettaz, surlignaz, pan ek zoom). Enn <a %(annas_archive_note_2971)s>komanter</a> par Joe Davis ti resone avek nou:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.second.quote"
msgstr "“Alor ki kare ek rektang perfetman simetrik zot matematikman agreab, zot pa donn superior lokalite dan enn kontks kartografik. Mo krwar ki lasimetri ineran dan sa bann Hilbert ouswa Morton klasik pa enn defo me enn karakteristik. Kouma kontour ki form enn bot ki fer Itali imedyatman rekonet lor enn map, bann \"bizarreri\" inik sa bann kourb la kapav servi kouma reper kognitif. Sa distinktivite la kapav amelyor memwar espasyal ek ed itilizater oryant zot, potansyelman fer lokaliz bann rezyon spesifik ouswa remark bann model pli fasil.”"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.second.text2"
msgstr "Ek ankor boukou opsion pou visualiz ek randre, osi bien ki enn UI extraordiner dou ek entuitif. Enn deziem plas solid!"

