#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.goals.text3"
msgstr "Depi ki Anna’s Archive li open source, nou anvi servi nou format direkteman. Kan nou rafresir nou index serch, nou aksede zis bann sime ki piblikman disponib, pou ki nenport ki ki fork nou bibliotèk kapav demare vitman."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.heading"
msgstr "Sa standar la"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.text1"
msgstr "Finalman, nou finn deside lor enn standar relativman senp. Li ase fleksib, pa normatif, ek enn travay an progre."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aac"
msgstr "<strong>AAC.</strong> AAC (Anna’s Archive Container) li enn sel item ki konpoze de <strong>metadata</strong>, ek opsionelman <strong>done biner</strong>, toulede ki pa kapav sanze. Li ena enn idantifian globalman inik, ki apel <strong>AACID</strong>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.collection"
msgstr "<strong>Koleksyon.</strong> Sak AAC apartenir a enn koleksyon, ki par definisyon li enn lis AAC ki semantikman konsistan. Sa vedir ki si ou fer enn sanzman sinifikatif dan format metadata, alor ou bizin kree enn nouvo koleksyon."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.records-files"
msgstr "<strong>Koleksyon “records” ek “files”.</strong> Par konvansyon, li souvan pratik pou pibliye “records” ek “files” kouma diferan koleksyon, alor zot kapav pibliye a diferan moman, par exanp baze lor to scraping. Enn “record” li enn koleksyon ki ena zis metadata, ki kontenir lenformasyon kouma tit liv, otter, ISBN, eksetera, tandik “files” se bann koleksyon ki kontenir bann dosie li-mem (pdf, epub)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid"
msgstr "<strong>AACID.</strong> Format AACID li koumsa: <code style=\"color: #0093ff\">aacid__{collection}__{ISO 8601 timestamp}__{collection-specific ID}__{shortuuid}</code>. Par exanp, enn vre AACID ki nou’nn pibliye se <code style=\"color: #0093ff\">aacid__zlib3_records__20230808T014342Z__22433983__URsJNGy5CjokTsNT6hUmmj</code>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.collection"
msgstr "<code>{collection}</code>: nom koleksyon, ki kapav kontenir lèt ASCII, sif, ek underscores (me pa double underscores)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.iso8601"
msgstr "<code>{ISO 8601 timestamp}</code>: enn versyon kourt ISO 8601, toultan an UTC, par exanp <code>20220723T194746Z</code>. Sa sif la bizin ogmante monotonikman pou sak pibliyasyon, mem si so semantik exak kapav diferan par koleksyon. Nou propoz pou servi ler scraping ou ler generasyon ID."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.collection-id"
msgstr "<code>{collection-specific ID}</code>: enn idantifian spesifik pou koleksyon, si aplikab, par exanp Z-Library ID. Kapav omet ou tronke. Bizin omet ou tronke si AACID depas 150 karaktèr."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.shortuuid"
msgstr "<code>{shortuuid}</code>: enn UUID me komprimé an ASCII, par exanp servi base57. Nou aktielman servi <a %(github_skorokithakis_shortuuid)s>shortuuid</a> libreri Python."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid-range"
msgstr "<strong>Gamme AACID.</strong> Parski AACIDs ena bann timestamp ki ogmante de fason monotone, nou kapav servi sa pou indike bann gammes dan enn koleksyon partikilye. Nou servi sa format-la: <code style=\"color: blue\">aacid__{collection}__{from_timestamp}--{to_timestamp}</code>, kot bann timestamps-la inklusif. Sa konsistan avek notasyon ISO 8601. Bann gammes-la kontinie, ek kapav sipermpoze, me dan ka sipermpozisyon bizin ena bann records identik kouma sa ki ti deza pibliye dan sa koleksyon-la (parski AACs pa kapav sanze). Bann records mankan pa aksepte."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file"
msgstr "<strong>Fichier metadata.</strong> Enn fichier metadata kontien metadata enn gamme AACs, pou enn koleksyon partikilye. Sa bann-la ena bann propriete swivan:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.filename"
msgstr "Nom fichier bizin enn gamme AACID, prefix avek <code style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</code> ek sufix avek <code>.jsonl.zstd</code>. Par exanp, enn parmi nou bann pibliyasyon apel<br><code><span style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__zlib3_records__20230808T014342Z--20230808T023702Z</span>.jsonl.zst</code>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.jsonlines"
msgstr "Kouma indike par l'extension fichier, tipe fichier-la se <a %(jsonlines)s>JSON Lines</a> komprime avek <a %(zstd)s>Zstandard</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.fields"
msgstr "Sak obze JSON bizin kontien bann chan swivan dan nivo siperyer: <strong>aacid</strong>, <strong>metadata</strong>, <strong>data_folder</strong> (opsyonel). Pa kapav ena lezot chan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.metadata"
msgstr "<code>metadata</code> se enn metadata arbitraire, dapre semantik koleksyon-la. Li bizin semantikman konsistan dan koleksyon-la."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.data_folder"
msgstr "<code>data_folder</code> se opsyonel, ek li nom folder done biner ki kontien bann done biner korespondan. Nom fichier bann done biner korespondan dan sa folder-la se AACID record-la."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.prefix"
msgstr "Prefix <code style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</code> kapav adapte avek nom ou l'institisyon, par exanp <code style=\"color: red\">my_institute_meta__</code>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.binary"
msgstr "<strong>Folder done biner.</strong> Enn folder avek bann done biner enn gamme AACs, pou enn koleksyon partikilye. Sa bann-la ena bann propriete swivan:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.binary.name"
msgstr "Nom direktwar bizin enn gamme AACID, prefix avek <code style=\"color: green\">annas_archive_data__</code>, ek pa ena sufix. Par exanp, enn parmi nou bann pibliyasyon reel ena enn direktwar ki apel<br><code><span style=\"color: green\">annas_archive_data__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__zlib3_files__20230808T055130Z--20230808T055131Z</span></code>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.binary.contents"
msgstr "Direktwar-la bizin kontien bann fichiers done pou tou AACs dan gamme spesifie. Sak fichier done bizin ena so AACID kouma nom fichier (pa ena l'extension)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.binary.tip"
msgstr "Nou rekomande pou fer sa bann folders-la enn tigit pli fasil pou jere dan so size, par exanp pa pli gran ki 100GB-1TB sakenn, bien ki sa rekomandasyon-la kapav sanze avek letan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.torrents"
msgstr "<strong>Torrents.</strong> Bann fichiers metadata ek folders done biner kapav regroupe dan torrents, avek enn torrent par fichier metadata, ou enn torrent par folder done biner. Bann torrents-la bizin ena nom orizinal fichier/direktwar plus enn <code>.torrent</code> sufix kouma zot nom fichier."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.heading"
msgstr "Exanp"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text1"
msgstr "Get nou dernie pibliyasyon Z-Library kouma enn exanp. Li konpoze de koleksyon: “<span style=\"background: #fffaa3\">zlib3_records</span>” ek “<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>”. Sa permet nou separeman gratte ek pibliye bann records metadata depi bann fichiers liv reel. Koumsa, nou finn pibliye de torrents avek bann fichiers metadata:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text2"
msgstr "Nou finn osi pibliye enn seri torrents avek bann folders done biner, me zis pou koleksyon “<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>”, 62 an total:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text3"
msgstr "An kouran <code>zstdcat <span style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #fffaa3\">zlib3_records</span>__20230808T014342Z--20230808T023702Z.jsonl.zst</span></code> nou kapav trouve ki ena ladan:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text4"
msgstr "Dan sa ka-la, li metadata enn liv kouma raporte par Z-Library. Dan nivo siperyer nou ena zis “aacid” ek “metadata”, me pa “data_folder”, parski pena done biner korespondan. AACID-la kontien “22430000” kouma ID primar, ki nou kapav trouve in tire depi “zlibrary_id”. Nou kapav atann lezot AACs dan sa koleksyon-la pou ena mem struktur."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text5"
msgstr "Asterla nou <code>zstdcat <span style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>__20230808T051503Z--20230809T223215Z.jsonl.zst</span></code>:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text6"
msgstr "Sa enn metadata AAC pli tipti, me lamazorite sa AAC-la trouv dan enn dosie biner lezot kote! Finalman, nou ena enn “data_folder” sa fwa-la, alor nou kapav atann ki bann done biner korespondan trouv dan <code><span style=\"color: green\">annas_archive_data__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>__20230808T051503Z--20230808T051504Z</span>/<span style=\"color: #0093ff\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>__20230808T051503Z__22433983__NRgUGwTJYJpkQjTbz2jA3M</span></code>. “Metadata” la kontien “zlibrary_id”, alor nou kapav fasilman asosie li avek AAC korespondan dan koleksion “zlib_records”. Nou ti kapav asosie li dan plizier fason diferan, par exanp atraver AACID — standar pa preskrir sa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text7"
msgstr "Note ki li pa neseser ki “metadata” li-mem li enn JSON. Li kapav enn string ki kontien XML ouswa nenport ki lezot format done. Ou kapav mem stoke lenformasion metadata dan blob biner asosie, par exanp si ena boukou done."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.conclusion.heading"
msgstr "Konklizion"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.conclusion.text1"
msgstr "Ave sa standar-la, nou kapav fer bann sorti pli inkreman, ek azout nouvo sours done pli fasilman. Nou deza ena detrwa sorti exitan dan pipeline!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.conclusion.text2"
