msgstr "Lafokis sa proze la ilistre par so nom:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.focus.pirate"
msgstr "<strong>Pirate</strong> - Nou deliberman viol lalwa copyright dan laplipar pei. Sa permet nou fer kitsoz ki bann lorganizasion legal pa kapav fer: asire ki bann liv mirwar lwen ek larz."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.focus.library"
msgstr "<strong>Bibliotek</strong> - Kouma boukou biblioteks, nou met laksan lo bann materyo ekri kouma bann liv. Nou kapav agrandi pou inklir lezot tip medya dan lavenir."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.focus.mirror"
msgstr "<strong>Miroir</strong> - Nou enn mirwar striktman pou bann bibliotek ki deza existe. Nou met laksan lo prezervasion, pa lo fer bann liv fasilman rechersab ek telechargab (akses) ouswa kree enn gran kominote dimounn ki kontribie nouvo liv (soursing)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text3"
msgstr "Premie bibliotek ki nou’nn mirwar se Z-Library. Sa enn bibliotek popiler (ek ilegal). Zot finn pran koleksion Library Genesis ek fer li fasilman rechersab. Anplis, zot vinn bien efikas pou demann nouvo kontribision liv, an motivan bann itilizater kontribian avek diferan avantaj. Zot pa kontribie sa bann nouvo liv-la an retour a Library Genesis. Ek, a diferans Library Genesis, zot pa fer zot koleksion fasilman mirwarab, ki anpes enn gran prezervasion. Sa inportan pou zot model biznes, parski zot sarz larzan pou akses zot koleksion an gro (plis ki 10 liv par zour)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text4"
msgstr "Nou pa fer zizman moral lor sarz larzan pou akse an gro enn koleksion liv ilegal. Li san dout ki Z-Library finn reisi agrandi akse a konesans, ek sours plis liv. Nou la zis pou fer nou par: asire prezervasion a long term sa koleksion prive-la."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text5"
msgstr "Nou ti a kontan envit ou pou ed prezerv ek libere konesans imin an telechargan ek partaz nou bann torrents. Get paz proze pou plis informasion lor kouma done organize."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text6"
msgstr "Nou ti a osi bien kontan envit ou pou kontribie ou bann lide lor ki koleksion pou mirwar prosin, ek kouma pou fer li. Ansam nou kapav akonpli boukou. Sa zis enn ti kontribision parmi enn kantite lezot. Mersi, pou tou seki ou fer."

