#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.tldr"
msgstr "<em><strong>TL;DR:</strong> Anna’s Archive finn scrape tou WorldCat (pli gran koleksion metadata bibliotèk dan lemond) pou fer enn lis TODO liv ki bizin prezervé.</em>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text1"
msgstr "Enn lane desela, nou <a %(blog)s>finn koumanse</a> pou reponn sa kestion-la: <strong>Ki poursan liv finn prezervé de manier permanan par bibliotèk lonbraz?</strong>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text2"
msgstr "Enn fwa ki enn liv rant dan enn bibliotèk lonbraz open-data kouma <a %(wikipedia_library_genesis)s>Library Genesis</a>, ek aster <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Anna’s Archive</a>, li reparti partou dan lemond (atraver torrents), alor li preske prezervé pou toultan."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text3"
msgstr "Pou reponn kestion lor ki poursan liv finn prezervé, nou bizin kone ki denominateur: konbien liv existe an total? Ek idealman nou pa zis ena enn sif, me vre metadata. Apre nou kapav pa zis matche zot kont bibliotèk lonbraz, me osi <strong>kre enn lis TODO liv ki reste pou prezervé!</strong> Nou kapav mem koumanse reve enn zefor crowdsourced pou desann sa lis TODO-la."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text4"
msgstr "Nou finn scrape <a %(wikipedia_isbndb_com)s>ISBNdb</a>, ek telechargé <a %(openlibrary)s>Open Library dataset</a>, me rezilta pa ti satisfesan. Problem prinsipal ti ki pa ti ena boukou overlap ISBNs. Get sa diagram Venn depi <a %(blog)s>nou post lor blog</a>:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text5"
msgstr "Nou ti bien sirpran par kouma ti ena tigit overlap ant ISBNdb ek Open Library, toulede ki liberalman inklir done depi plizier sours, kouma web scrapes ek records bibliotèk. Si zot toulede fer enn bon travay pou trouv laplipar ISBNs deor, zot sirk ti pou sirman ena enn gran overlap, ouswa enn ti pou enn sous-ensam de lot. Sa fer nou poz kestion, konbien liv tonbe <em>net deor sa sirk-la</em>? Nou bizin enn pli gran database."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.worldcat"
msgstr "WorldCat"

